NAME
    who - list sessions and their active accounts

SYNOPSIS
    who

DESCRIPTION
    Prints each active tmux(1) session alongside the account it is
    running as, marking the current session with '(current)'. When the
    host does not enable session management, prints the single shell's
    account as '(this shell)'.

EXAMPLES
    who

EXIT STATUS
    0   Always succeeds.

SEE ALSO
    whoami(1), su(1), tmux(1), ps(1)
